{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/605d93420e9d48be5c6a8d25e6c5da75.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <i>THE CORRIDOR</i> comes<strong> It Takes a War</strong>\u00a0- a team-based shooter with <strong>VISCERAL</strong> gunplay and <strong>RELENTLESS</strong> action. Throw yourself into <strong>RELENTLESSLY VISCERAL</strong> combat where survival is entirely dependent on communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no 'i' in 'team', but there is in <strong>VICTORY</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If possible, we recommend making sure you have enough time to play a full It Takes a War game in one session as not to disappoint your teammates. A single play of It Takes a War consists of around 45-60 minutes of playtime.</i>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/19ce5bad0462bdfae97a78827714a358.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastatingly real depiction of the battlefield. You won't believe your eyes (or ears)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/cf36edb96ace4262adfa100cccdf7191.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your playstyle via one of three totally unique combat classes - play <i>your</i> way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/f1a1a404e722bc29333a042af98ddcc8.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary 'Voice Chat' allows you to connect with your team in real-time, sharing intel and strategies on the fly. OVER!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/7c0c4bb8754d75352d7bd337a291a041.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra Realism</strong> - cutting edge graphics will transport you to the frontlines of battle... and beyond!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic weapons</strong> - take down a well-armed foe with an assortment of very nice and very real-looking guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is key </strong>- connect with your team in real-time via 'Voice Chat'!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Combat</strong> - absolutely nothing under the surface to distract from VISCERAL TACTICAL ACTION!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/f57fa2a2517298d9b96e5ee7b316865a.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Note: No generative AI was used in the making of this game or its associated assets.</i></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kids Were Playing With That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919530/acea47c12fb95c9102a2dfae83cee5219dfbb8e5.jpg"},{"name":"We Do Like to Have Fun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3919530/aa72ac09447ec269958f3eb6290045251c444bf7.jpg"},{"name":"All Chickens Go to Heaven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic