 Takes a War game in one session as not to disappoint your teammates. A single play of It Takes a War consists of around 45-60 minutes of playtime.</i>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/19ce5bad0462bdfae97a78827714a358.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastatingly real depiction of the battlefield. You won't believe your eyes (or ears)!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/cf36edb96ace4262adfa100cccdf7191.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your playstyle via one of three totally unique combat classes - play <i>your</i> way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/f1a1a404e722bc29333a042af98ddcc8.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary 'Voice Chat' allows you to connect with your team in real-time, sharing intel and strategies on the fly. OVER!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/7c0c4bb8754d75352d7bd337a291a041.avif?t=1762891756\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra Realism</strong> - cutting edge graphics will transport you to the frontlines of battle... and beyond!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic weapons</strong> - take down a well-armed foe with an assortment of very nice and very real-looking guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is